{% comment %}
  Renders an individual custom accordion card.
  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} Block object with settings
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign title = block.settings.heading | default: 'Deskripsi & Keunggulan (10-in-1)'
  assign content = block.settings.content
  assign page_content = block.settings.page.content
  assign icon_type = block.settings.icon | default: 'cookware'
-%}

<details class="exp-accordion-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <summary class="exp-accordion-header">
    <div class="exp-accordion-header__left">
      <span class="exp-accordion-icon">
        {%- case icon_type -%}
          {%- when 'shield' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline>
            </svg>
          {%- when 'clock' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
          {%- else -%}
            <!-- cookware / bag -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path>
              <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
              <path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path>
            </svg>
        {%- endcase -%}
      </span>
      <span class="exp-accordion-title">{{ title }}</span>
    </div>
    <span class="exp-accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
        <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </summary>
  <div class="exp-accordion-body rte">
    {%- if content != blank -%}
      {{ content }}
    {%- elsif page_content != blank -%}
      {{ page_content }}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- case icon_type -%}
        {%- when 'shield' -%}
          <p><strong>Material:</strong> Aluminium die-cast kualitas tinggi dengan konduksi panas merata.</p>
          <p><strong>Lapisan Non-Stick:</strong> Bebas PTFE, PFOA, Timbal, Cadmium, dan bahan kimia berbahaya lainnya (100% Non-Toxic).</p>
          <p><strong>Kelengkapan:</strong> Spatula kayu beechwood alami tahan panas & keranjang kukusan stainless steel 304 food-grade.</p>
        {%- when 'clock' -%}
          <p>Nikmati uji coba produk selama 100 hari di dapur Anda. Jika Anda tidak sepenuhnya puas dengan kualitasnya, kami memberikan garansi pengembalian dana 100% tanpa ribet.</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <p>Wajan inovatif pengganti 10 peralatan masak tradisional Anda: menumis, menggoreng, merebus, mengukus, memanggang, menyajikan, hingga menyimpan makanan dengan tutup modular yang pas dan corong tuang anti-tumpah.</p>
      {%- endcase -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</details>
